  "description": "“Urban Crazy” is a graffiti font that contains several different styles and layers within it. When these styles and layers are properly combined in a design, they can create a three-dimensional (3D) effect on the text. Fonts like this are often used in street art, posters, and other designs that aim to add dimension and depth to their typography.\nWith “Urban Crazy,” you have the flexibility to create text with various effects and styles, ranging from simple to highly complex. This allows you to customize the design according to your creative vision.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>“Urban Crazy” is a graffiti font that contains several different styles and layers within it. When these styles and layers are properly combined in a design, they can create a three-dimensional (3D) effect on the text. Fonts like this are often used in street art, posters, and other designs that aim to add dimension and depth to their typography.<br>\nWith “Urban Crazy,” you have the flexibility to create text with various effects and styles, ranging from simple to highly complex. This allows you to customize the design according to your creative vision.</p>",
